{"term":"resort","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:29c46427a4dc6d0b99","definition":"A place where people go for recreation, especially one with facilities such as lodgings, entertainment, and a relaxing environment.","example":"Was it deliberate that the first week of October 1961 was chosen to conduct a national survey of passenger usage? Why October of all months, when the holiday season was over and families back at work and at school? Was this a fiddling of the figures to make an unfair case against rail-dependent resorts such as those in the West Country, Norfolk, Lincolnshire and East Yorkshire, where previously overloaded summer services would now only have a handful of locals on board?","pos":"noun","synonyms":["playground"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["court of last resort","drug of last resort","ecoresort","health resort","lender of last resort","letter of last resort","megaresort","resort charge","resorter","resort fee","resortlike","resort town","seaside resort","Silverado Resort","ski resort","summer resort","last resort"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/resort#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:8bb630a4a49cd6d0a1","definition":"Recourse, refuge (something or someone turned to for safety).","example":"to have resort to violence","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["court of last resort","drug of last resort","ecoresort","health resort","lender of last resort","letter of last resort","megaresort","resort charge","resorter","resort fee","resortlike","resort town","seaside resort","Silverado Resort","ski resort","summer resort","last resort"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/resort#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:a426d3a08a121